<title>UK: Videotron seen meeting purchase conditions.</title>
<headline>Videotron seen meeting purchase conditions.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bell Cablemedia said on Wednesday that certain material conditions relating to the acquisition of a 56 percent stake in the Videotron Holdings Plc had been met and that it anticipated the remaining conditions will be satisfied by December 23.</p>
<p>The conditions already satisfied include the consents required from lenders and noteholders as well as certain regulatory approvals.</p>
<p>Bell Cablemedia which currently owns 26 percent of Videotron, is owned by Bell Canada International, a unit of BCE Inc, Canada's largest telecommunications company.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
